Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.59,0:00:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,SHIGEME
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.83,0:00:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been almost two years\Nsince this game of death began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.43,0:00:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still going it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.01,0:01:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fighting solo on the front lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.53,0:01:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akihiko Kayaba is out\Nthere somewhere, watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.21,0:01:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what he's thinking right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.67,0:01:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll head home.
