Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.29,0:03:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, this is the first\Ntime I've ever seen one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.59,0:03:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kirito, don't you already\Nhave all the money you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.49,0:03:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll buy it, but I'm saying, wouldn't\Nyou rather have it for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.19,0:04:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, it's just, well, who knows\Nif I'll ever get another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.43,0:04:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So keep it. What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.95,0:04:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, to prepare an item like this, you\Nneed to have a high enough cooking skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.83,0:04:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.09,0:04:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we try, we just burn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.25,0:04:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm... Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.51,0:04:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got my chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.91,0:04:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what chef?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.25,0:04:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Asuna's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.65,0:04:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing you in a dump like\Nthis is beyond weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.73,0:04:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.73,0:04:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came to see if you were still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.61,0:04:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, it's almost time\Nfor the next boss raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.11,0:04:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on your friend list.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.49,0:04:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to know I'm\Nalive, just check that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.49,0:04:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever, now I know you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.15,0:04:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.01,0:04:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's all this about a chef?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.79,0:04:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wondering what your\Ncooking skill level is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.27,0:04:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.18,0:04:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Totally maxed it out last week. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.45,0:04:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.07,0:05:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're that good, I need a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a Rabbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.39,0:05:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll trade you all you have\Nto do is cook it up for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.61,0:05:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'll let you have a little bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.51,0:05:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.05,0:05:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry pal, you heard the lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.03,0:05:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'm keeping it, yeah, but you\Ncould at least let me taste it right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.57,0:05:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we were tight man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.25,0:05:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll write a review for you,\Nbut only two pages promise
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.39,0:05:41.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, that is cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.59,0:05:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, where am I going to cook it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.15,0:05:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.19,0:05:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing not your place, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.27,0:05:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You even own any cookware?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.20,0:05:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because the main ingredient is special,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.13,0:05:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't have a problem if\Nwe used my place this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.77,0:06:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for escorting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.91,0:06:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.29,0:06:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, ma 'am, but I can't allow you\Nto go home with such a shady character.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know the extent of his\Nshadiness, but I know he's quite skilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.23,0:06:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, he's ten levels\Nabove you, Kuradeel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you implying I'm inferior to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.07,0:06:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.39,0:06:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's one of those beaters, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.35,0:06:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.26,0:06:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.33,0:06:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't go with him, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.01,0:06:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All him and his kind care\Nabout are themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.33,0:06:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't expect anything good\Nto come from scum like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.91,0:06:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Lightning Flash Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.31,0:06:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.57,0:06:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.31,0:06:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I'm second in command here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.13,0:06:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am ordering you to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.87,0:06:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.11,0:06:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
