Dialogue: 2,0:06:59.16,0:07:02.67,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\shad0\pos(960,942)\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&\fscx100}61{\fscx95}st Floor • Selmburg
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.47,0:07:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's hardly anyone around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.25,0:07:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.21,0:07:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you like it so much,\Nwhy don't you move here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.55,0:07:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.46,0:07:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This floor seems way\Nout of my price range.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.73,0:07:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what's the deal\Nwith that guy back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.31,0:07:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was mad-dogging me like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.65,0:07:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's just my bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.75,0:07:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Guild's new policy says all\Nhigher-ups have to have an escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.73,0:07:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.79,0:07:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Guild didn't have all these\Nrules and regulations before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.65,0:07:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We used to be really small.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, more and more people joined up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.47,0:07:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, when we became the strongest\Nguild, everything started getting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.07,0:07:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm probably making a\Nbigger deal out of it than it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.47,0:07:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.97,0:07:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.23,0:07:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.31,0:07:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you've got a killer pad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.65,0:08:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how much did all this cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.47,0:08:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The room and the furniture\Ncost around four million coal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.03,0:08:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.57,0:08:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.99,0:08:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy moly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four million.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.93,0:08:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that's a lot of coal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.65,0:08:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I've earned that much,\Ntoo, but blowing it all on a flat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.85,0:08:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to take\Noff your coat or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.19,0:08:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.69,0:08:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is a legendary Skills ingredient.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.17,0:08:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, how do you want this cooked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.33,0:08:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd leave that\Ndecision up to the chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.11,0:08:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, how about\Nwe make it into a stew?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.61,0:08:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ragoom.
