Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.16,0:08:58.41,Signs2,,0,0,0,,{\c&H1DB0F6&\blur0.9\alpha&H20\p1\fscx90\fscy43\pos(522.21,844.92)\frz18.82}m 0 0 l 150 0 150 150 0 150
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.43,0:09:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In real life, there'd be a lot more\Nsteps involved in preparing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.07,0:09:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cooking an SAO is so simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.17,0:09:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, it's kind of boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That takes care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.33,0:09:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now for the next step.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.03,0:09:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was thinking about making\Na couple side dishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.89,0:10:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been here two years and this is the\Nfirst time I've ever eaten Skills food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.97,0:10:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy I survived\Nlong enough to eat that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.33,0:10:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.21,0:10:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.37,0:10:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.71,0:10:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get this feeling that like\NI've lived here my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.25,0:10:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ever feel like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.07,0:10:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, almost all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.33,0:10:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, there's days I don't even\Nthink about the real world at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.75,0:10:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's not just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.85,0:10:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These days,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.76,0:10:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more and more people\Ndon't seem to care about
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.33,0:10:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,clearing the game and getting\Nback to the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.45,0:10:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I notice there's not that many players\Nout there fighting on the front lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.25,0:10:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe 500, if that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.31,0:10:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess they're used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.47,0:10:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't care anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.17,0:10:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I want to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.59,0:10:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, there's things I haven't done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.41,0:10:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.37,0:10:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.83,0:10:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when you stop to consider\Nit, there's everyone else, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.23,0:10:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the people who still count on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.19,0:10:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we give up, it's not fair to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.41,0:11:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go there. What I've\Nseen that same look on guys
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.67,0:11:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,faces before and always right\Nbefore they proposed to me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.87,0:11:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should see your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you never had a girlfriend before
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.87,0:11:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.31,0:11:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a solo player
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.41,0:11:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're okay with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.13,0:11:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't ever want to join a guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.03,0:11:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how the beta players\Ndon't fit in with the guilds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.57,0:11:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But ever since we got to Floor 70,\Nthings are getting more dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.41,0:11:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The monster algorithms\Nare even more irregular.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.15,0:11:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are things a solo\Nplayer can't handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.27,0:11:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unexpected things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.95,0:11:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, warping out isn't an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.81,0:11:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I'm pretty careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I work better by myself anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.55,0:12:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, most of the time, instead of\Nhelping, party members just get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.45,0:12:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.47,0:12:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.38,0:12:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone except for you. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.21,0:12:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do you say you\Nand me team up again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.17,0:12:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black's my lucky color this week anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.55,0:12:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold up a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.67,0:12:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you have stuff you\Nhave to do for your guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.61,0:12:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't just bail on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.89,0:12:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like we have any\Nleveling quotas to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.41,0:12:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then what about your bodyguard?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.21,0:12:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just ditch him.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.76,0:12:50.10,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\pos(721,928.5)\c&HE4ECED&\blur0.75\fs45}has invited you to join her party.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.76,0:12:50.10,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\pos(721,927)\c&H778089&\blur1.05\fs45}has invited you to join her party.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.41,0:12:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The front lines are dangerous, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.13,0:13:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.53,0:13:04.40,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBEDEC&\blur0.75\fs45\pos(844.995,398.505)\frz351}has invited you to join her party.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.53,0:13:04.40,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\c&H8E9193&\blur0.9\fs45\pos(844.995,397.005)\frz351}has invited you to join her party.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.40,0:13:04.45,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\c&H8E9193&\blur0.9\fs37.5\frz351\pos(883.005,394.995)}has invited you to join her party.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.11,0:13:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose thanks are in\Norder for the meal, so thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.25,0:13:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for cooking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.89,0:13:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.13,0:13:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.33,0:13:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never get my hands on\Nsomething like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.55,0:13:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.46,0:13:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can make anything yummy if\Nyou have the skills to cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.49,0:13:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking at this world and seeing\Nwhat it's become since we got here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.63,0:13:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is this really what Akihiko\NKayaba wanted to create?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.19,0:13:49.45,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(570,500)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H292E32&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H091E1C&}October {\fscx110}18{\fscx95}th, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}       {\fscx105}74{\fscx95}th Floor • Kamdet
