Dialogue: 2,0:13:45.19,0:13:49.45,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(570,500)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\shad0\pos(960,942)\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&}October {\fscx110}18{\fscx95}th, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}       {\fscx105}74{\fscx95}th Floor • Kamdet
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.33,0:13:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.85,0:13:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.76,0:13:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.29,0:14:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.19,0:14:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, squishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.79,0:14:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.59,0:14:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.69,0:14:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.57,0:14:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.93,0:14:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you behaving like this, ma 'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.05,0:14:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm only following orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.03,0:14:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, let's go back to headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.23,0:14:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't, especially not with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.83,0:14:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why were you lurking around\Nmy house in the morning, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.11,0:15:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a bad habit of\Nleaving without any warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.37,0:15:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So for the past month,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.65,0:15:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,part of my mission has been to\Nkeep an eye on you in Selmburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.59,0:15:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.50,0:15:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who ordered this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.47,0:15:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't the commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.93,0:15:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all due respect, ma 'am,\Nmy mission is to guard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.07,0:15:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter where you are,\Nincluding your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.63,0:15:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it doesn't, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.63,0:15:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you would be a little more\Nunderstanding about this, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.05,0:15:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, let's return to headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.83,0:15:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'll be borrowing your\Nsecond-in-command for the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.97,0:15:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you'll just have to\Nmake do without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.87,0:15:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take responsibility for her security.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.95,0:15:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it's not like\Nwe're going on a boss raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.79,0:15:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can go, she'll be fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.33,0:15:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Insolent punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.43,0:15:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.21,0:15:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a member of the Glorious\NKnights of the Blood Oath!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.05,0:15:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A low-level player like\Nyou couldn't protect her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.79,0:15:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do a better job of it than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.25,0:15:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got a big mouth, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.23,0:16:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm going to give you a chance to\Nprove just how tough you really are.
