Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.55,0:16:17.18,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\c&H989EA7&\frz16.73\fax-0.13\pos(765,323.001)\fs45}You have accepted the duel request.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.15,0:16:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please move to a safe distance, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.47,0:16:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to prove beyond any doubt that\NI am the only one who can protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.25,0:16:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito's gonna duel a guy from\Nthe Knights of the Blood Oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.53,0:16:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This'll be fun to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.19,0:17:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.11,0:17:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.95,0:17:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, he destroyed his sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.47,0:17:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.71,0:17:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to try again with another\Nweapon, I'll be glad to take you on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.71,0:17:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or we can call it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.23,0:17:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.65,0:17:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how, but he cheated!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.99,0:17:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw how he destroyed my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.09,0:17:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have used some kind of trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.11,0:18:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no other way I could have\Nlost to a pathetic beater like him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.33,0:18:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuradeel,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.29,0:18:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as second in command of the\NKnights of the Blood Oath,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.03,0:18:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm relieving you of your\Nduties as my bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.41,0:18:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're to return to headquarters\Nand wait for further orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.61,0:18:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.63,0:18:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.41,0:18:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teleport.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.67,0:18:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gransom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.31,0:18:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.75,0:18:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to drag you into that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.99,0:18:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.69,0:18:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about you. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.31,0:18:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.22,0:18:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Guild's getting on my nerves is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.39,0:19:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe because I've been so\Nfocused on clearing the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.39,0:19:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe because I'm so demanding\Nof the other members in the Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.69,0:19:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you didn't have much of a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.41,0:19:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.32,0:19:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you'd done things any different,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.91,0:19:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you think your guild would have\Ngotten as far as they have?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.41,0:19:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, what do I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.15,0:19:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just mess around as\Na solo player, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.77,0:19:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, if you take a day off to\Nteam up with a loser like me, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.51,0:19:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's your decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.85,0:19:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my opinion, no one's\Ngot the right to complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.43,0:19:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.97,0:19:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, thank you for your\Nopinion on the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.05,0:19:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,OK, I accept your offer and I'll\Nbe taking a day off from the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.53,0:19:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can play forward today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.15,0:19:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.06,0:19:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.98,0:19:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't we supposed to\Ntake turns as forward?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.79,0:19:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's my day off, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.13,0:19:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.15,0:19:59.65,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H1D1E1F&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H091E1C&\fscx105}74{\fscx95}th Floor • Labyrinth
