Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.05,0:20:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having someone along who knows how\Nto fight sure makes things easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.71,0:20:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Switch with me, Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.53,0:20:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.31,0:20:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.45,0:20:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.95,0:20:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.85,0:20:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found the boss room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.47,0:21:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.65,0:21:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you think we should look inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.51,0:21:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we came all this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.37,0:21:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, boss monsters never\Nleave the rooms they guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.19,0:21:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we'll be okay\Nif we just take a peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.21,0:21:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.43,0:21:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a teleport crystal\Nready, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.89,0:21:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.69,0:21:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, are you ready? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.65,0:22:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here. We're here. I
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.79,0:22:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heard
